title: OptionsTest
---
NPC: Want to buy a [c1]stick[/c1]?
-> Yes
    // Switch to the blue dialogue style
    <<hide_dialogue>>
    <<set_dialogue_style blue>>
    Great! You now own this fantastic [c1]stick[/c1]! #icon:ItemStick #end
-> No
    NPC: Oh. Nobody wants to buy my [c1]stick[/c1].
    NPC: Dang it! #center #end
