title: LinesTest
---
NPC: Hey, I'm an NPC! [pause=500/] [speed=120]How cool is that![/speed]
NPC: I'm gonna [speed=0]say [pause=500/]some [pause=500/]words [pause=500/]one [pause=500/]by [pause=500/]one[/speed]!!!
NPC: Look at me go!
NPC: [speed=5]...[/speed][pause=1000/][speed=30]......[/speed]
NPC: Wait...
NPC: You aren't saying anything at all! #noskip
NPC: Well bye #end
