title: NPCVideoTest
---
NPC: Hi! I'm a friendly merchant!
NPC: Why am I out here at night and not inside the town walls?
NPC: [speed=0]It's [pause=500/]simple!![/speed] [pause=1000/] [speed=100]I'm a [c0]crook[/c0]![/]
NPC: Anyway[speed=5]...[/speed] [pause=500/] buy my wares!
-> Buy a stick
    <<hide_dialogue>>
    <<set_dialogue_style blue>>
    You now own this fantastic [c1]stick[/c1]! This wasn't a great investment. #icon:ItemStick #end
    <<hide_dialogue>>
    <<set_dialogue_style normal>>
-> Don't buy

NPC: Well, see you later!

